Package: gbmux
Version: 1.0-1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: cannibaltoast
Depends: acpi-call-dkms, pciutils, kmod, curl, psmisc, procps
Recommends: dmidecode
Description: Gigabyte AERO X16 display-mux and dGPU power control
 Linux implementation of GiMATE's GPU Mux Switch + GpuPowerGear dGPU-off.
 Talks to the Gigabyte EC through the GB_WMIACPI WMI/ACPI interface
 (\_SB.PCI0.AMW0 WMBC/WMBD) — the same path wmiacpi.sys uses on Windows.
 .
  gbmux status            current mux mode + dGPU state
  gbmux dynamic|discrete|hybrid   set BIOS mux mode (applies at next POST)
  gbmux gpu on|off        runtime dGPU power gate (EC + PCIe rescan)
  gbmux-setup             fetch + install pinned NVIDIA driver (615.71.09)
 .
 Confirmed on GIGABYTE AERO X16 1WH, BIOS FB07, RTX 5070 (GB206M)
 + AMD Krackan iGPU. Requires the ABBC0F75 Gigabyte WMI GUID.
